window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-671f15d070027b59"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"data-science\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">数据科学</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>将问题、仪表板和原始数据转化为可供审阅的分析成果。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 汇总仪表板、指标定义、数据导出、实验记录和相关方背景，形成其他人能够审阅并据此采取行动的分析。ChatGPT 可以把计算过程、来源、注意事项和待确认问题清楚地呈现出来，让分析人员在分享结果前先核验依据。</p> <p><a id=\"scope-and-investigate-questions\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">界定分析问题并展开调查</h2> <p>把含糊的请求整理成清晰的分析计划，或围绕相关细分群体和背景调查意外的 KPI 变化。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/analytics-request-agent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">梳理数据分析需求（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供相关方的请求、业务背景、指标词汇表、来源数据导出……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/kpi-root-cause-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">分析 KPI 根因（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供 KPI 仪表板、指标定义、数据导出、细分数据、发布背景以及……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"measure-and-explain-performance\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">衡量并解释表现</h2> <p>评估实验或发布的影响，并把周期性 KPI 和业务输入整理成有来源依据的业绩说明。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/business-impact-readout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">衡量业务影响（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供实验或发布计划、成功指标、群组数据、仪表板导出……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/monthly-business-review-narrative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备业务回顾（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供 KPI 仪表板、结账工作簿、指标定义、预测更新和以往……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"design-dashboards-and-monitoring\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">设计仪表板和监控方案</h2> <p>为支持决策的仪表板明确 KPI 层级、图表规格、质量检查、负责人和监控计划。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/dashboard-builder-monitor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">规划仪表板与监控工作流（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供战略简介、工作流背景、指标定义和来源数据导出……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"data-science\">Data Science</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Turn questions, dashboards, and raw data into review-ready analysis.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex to turn dashboards, metric definitions, exports, experiment notes, and stakeholder context into analysis that others can review and act on. ChatGPT can keep calculations, sources, caveats, and open questions visible so analysts can validate the evidence before sharing it.</p> <h2 id=\"scope-and-investigate-questions\">Scope and investigate questions</h2> <p>Turn an ambiguous request into a clear analysis plan, or investigate an unexpected KPI movement across the segments and context that matter.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/analytics-request-agent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scope an analytics request (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT the stakeholder request, business context, metric glossary, source exports...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/kpi-root-cause-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Analyze KPI root causes (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT KPI dashboards, metric definitions, exports, segment cuts, launch context, and...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"measure-and-explain-performance\">Measure and explain performance</h2> <p>Evaluate the impact of an experiment or launch, and turn recurring KPI and business inputs into a source-backed performance narrative.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/business-impact-readout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Measure business impact (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT an experiment or launch plan, success metrics, cohort data, dashboard exports...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/monthly-business-review-narrative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare a business review (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT KPI dashboards, close workbooks, metric definitions, forecast updates, prior...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"design-dashboards-and-monitoring\">Design dashboards and monitoring</h2> <p>Define the KPI hierarchy, chart specifications, quality checks, owners, and monitoring plan behind a decision-ready dashboard.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/dashboard-builder-monitor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plan a dashboard and monitoring workflow (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT a strategy brief, workflow context, metric definitions, source exports...</li> </ul>"};
